    "detailed_description": "3D idle RPG game, players will embark on snowy mountains, ancient castles, grasslands, to explore the ancient mysterious treasures. You can easily hang up and enjoy it, but also through the manual release of skills to feel the excitement of the boss battle.<br />\r\n\u3010RPG Game\u3011<br />\r\nThe game incorporates RPG elements, with a skill system, achievement system and a very rich equipment system, allowing players to experience diverse role-playing fun.<br />\r\n\u3010Easy to get started, simple to operate\u3011<br />\r\nThe game is easy to use and easy to learn, so even cute girls can play it quickly.<br />\r\n\u3010Placement gameplay\u3011<br />\r\nWhen the player exits the game, the knight will continue the adventure in the background, helping the player to accumulate experience and gold, and when the player enters the game, he can sit back and continue the adventure at any time. <br />\r\n\u3010Skill System\u3011<br />\r\nPlayers will unlock several skills in the game, each skill can be set with different runes to obtain various special effects<br />\r\n\u3010Equipment System\u3011<br />\r\nEquipment is divided into weapons, armor and accessories. By spending gold, you can improve your equipment attributes to make you more powerful!<br />\r\nEquipment attributes are randomly generated, so the adventure is full of surprises at any time!<br />\r\n\u3010Pet System\u3011<br />\r\nIn the game you can get different shapes and attributes of pets, accompanied by the player in the leisure of the road is no longer lonely.<br />\r\n\u3010Promotion System\u3011<br />\r\nYou can upgrade your attributes by way of promotion. The promotion function of the game will be opened automatically when specific requirements are completed. After promotion, players can get rewards and keep their current level, skills, attributes, pets, etc., so that they can become more powerful and break through the more horrible abyss!",
    "about_the_game": "3D idle RPG game, players will embark on snowy mountains, ancient castles, grasslands, to explore the ancient mysterious treasures. You can easily hang up and enjoy it, but also through the manual release of skills to feel the excitement of the boss battle.<br />\r\n\u3010RPG Game\u3011<br />\r\nThe game incorporates RPG elements, with a skill system, achievement system and a very rich equipment system, allowing players to experience diverse role-playing fun.<br />\r\n\u3010Easy to get started, simple to operate\u3011<br />\r\nThe game is easy to use and easy to learn, so even cute girls can play it quickly.<br />\r\n\u3010Placement gameplay\u3011<br />\r\nWhen the player exits the game, the knight will continue the adventure in the background, helping the player to accumulate experience and gold, and when the player enters the game, he can sit back and continue the adventure at any time. <br />\r\n\u3010Skill System\u3011<br />\r\nPlayers will unlock several skills in the game, each skill can be set with different runes to obtain various special effects<br />\r\n\u3010Equipment System\u3011<br />\r\nEquipment is divided into weapons, armor and accessories. By spending gold, you can improve your equipment attributes to make you more powerful!<br />\r\nEquipment attributes are randomly generated, so the adventure is full of surprises at any time!<br />\r\n\u3010Pet System\u3011<br />\r\nIn the game you can get different shapes and attributes of pets, accompanied by the player in the leisure of the road is no longer lonely.<br />\r\n\u3010Promotion System\u3011<br />\r\nYou can upgrade your attributes by way of promotion. The promotion function of the game will be opened automatically when specific requirements are completed. After promotion, players can get rewards and keep their current level, skills, attributes, pets, etc., so that they can become more powerful and break through the more horrible abyss!",
    "short_description": "It is a 3D RPG idle game. The game integrates RPG elements, with skill system, achievement system and very rich equipment system, so that players can experience diversified role-playing fun.",
